    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kiana &amp; Biscuit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro platforming game where two ladies, <strong>Kiana</strong> and <strong>Biscuit</strong> go on a vacation to a private island to spend time with their partners, only to be interrupted by dastardly pirates! <strong>Jump, Collect coconuts and tokens,</strong> <strong>beat the par times,</strong> and <strong>aim for high ranks</strong> to unlock images in the <strong>gallery</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four worlds to explore and platform through!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/445378d0fabc90d88f1fd1ca19f0f27e.poster.avif?t=1734232088\" width=320 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/445378d0fabc90d88f1fd1ca19f0f27e.webm?t=1734232088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/445378d0fabc90d88f1fd1ca19f0f27e.mp4?t=1734232088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast paced gameplay that keeps you on your toes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/72535f7f4dd37f34d738ec6bbd5c3f91.poster.avif?t=1734232088\" width=320 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/72535f7f4dd37f34d738ec6bbd5c3f91.webm?t=1734232088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306040/extras/72535f7f4dd37f34d738ec6bbd5c3f91.mp